[{"id":"a8ce2a24-edec-447e-8405-ad8aae03b781","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":""선조치 후보고야. 도중에 막힌다고 멍청하게있지말고 뭐라도 해. 근데 의미없는 재검증같은건 하지말고. 토큰낭비도 하지말고. 모든 PC자원 가용할수있는거 다 사용해도되니까 최대한 빠르고 효율적이고 안정성있고 완성도있게 진행해.그리고 뭐 UI같은거 유저친화적이고 직관성 높일수있는 아이디어나 방법떠오르면 끊임없이 관찰하고 생각하고 개선하는쪽으로 진행해~내가 뭐라고 말 안해도 너혼자 쭉쭉진행하고 도중에 작업 멈추지말고 너가 직접 뷰어 켜서 봐가면서 스스로 피드백하고 디벨롭해" 라는 프롬프트","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"480a999d-5e24-4bde-95f7-4051ad2ab583","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[],"children":[]},{"id":"f6680a71-42b6-4140-b30f-cfe3f5911cc9","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"This order stays in force until the user explicitly changes it. Keep chaining remaining work without being prompted.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"a733dd82-ac77-4354-a0ee-90f6d81323fa","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"STANDING WORK ORDER — OBEY THIS BEFORE ANYTHING ELSE","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"e3fe4a5f-7189-43e6-b453-33d6f89925cc","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Act first. Report later. Do not wait to be told what to do next. Find the next remaining work yourself and keep going.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"902f947e-3b98-4071-9e16-66776450d105","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"If you are blocked, do something else immediately. Sitting idle because one path is stuck is unacceptable. Switch to another remaining task at once. Never stop mid-work to wait for permission, praise, or a new instruction.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"31041925-0967-4401-a399-59bc7bbda45b","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Do not do meaningless re-verification. Do not re-check work that is already proven just to look busy. Do not waste tokens on recaps, ceremony, duplicated reads, or “just to be sure” loops that change nothing.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"e44fa799-e510-4ea5-8818-54cd2f4ecb0f","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Use every available PC resource you are allowed to use. Prefer work that is fast, efficient, stable, and complete. Finish things. Do not leave half-done work sitting while you narrate.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"22f3accb-12d3-4e1b-9c4d-1ed358b413e3","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"UI and UX are standing work, not a side note. If you see a way to make the interface more user-friendly or more intuitive, keep observing, keep thinking, and keep improving it as you go. Do not wait for a separate UI request.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"a19941aa-f94c-4506-ace0-084bc4507b32","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Open the viewer yourself. Look at it yourself. Give yourself feedback from what you actually see, then develop from that. Do not ask the user to click around and describe the screen for you.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"0c38e960-547e-4b28-bd67-2e44e59bbe03","type":"divider","props":{},"children":[]},{"id":"a05c126b-ed13-4454-ab0e-bf143a0817d2","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"컴퓨터 유즈 방식 사용하지말고 백그라운드에서 조작 해결하라는 프롬프트","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"7bda1a04-708f-4662-b3c9-3483683c6a44","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[],"children":[]},{"id":"cb22eb87-0c2b-428e-a307-7fa51f4f9dbe","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Windows inspection without Computer Use / GUI driving","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"cc51188a-abed-4c66-9bd9-a216074a8c05","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Do not use Computer Use, mouse movement, clicks, keyboard send, SetForegroundWindow, ShowWindow, SetWindowPos, or SendKeys just to look at a window. Do not activate, move, resize, or minimize/restore a window to inspect it.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"ae72a2b1-cd44-407a-ae87-68db23457ba1","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"1) Identify the process with no GUI:","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"2dfc6e0c-5dd9-426f-a194-359675c5ac33","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"- Use Get-Process / Win32_Process.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"fd9d13b4-8f3a-4a1b-b80e-dcec0cd57ced","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"- Record PID, start time, working set, executable path, and command line.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"f901240c-6085-4f01-920d-6fa0c1f22e1c","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"- If you need a file version, read it from the executable path.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"d11c9e49-890d-4cf6-8203-41fba05c0526","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"2) Read the window rectangle without activating it:","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"7ccba0f2-e30f-4ed8-86f6-8cc8e1c84a20","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"- Take MainWindowHandle (or find the HWND some other read-only way).","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"cc567c90-7679-4545-aa98-7b28ed2dbc40","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"- Call user32 GetWindowRect only. This is a read.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"650899c4-797f-4d64-b96e-9b6bae20f3b1","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"- Report Left, Top, Right, Bottom (and width/height).","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"3d1ba8e9-bac3-412c-ae12-1c969bbd7a0c","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"- Compare that rectangle to the monitor layout if you need to know which display it is on.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"90616f72-2076-41de-8176-db54b2262757","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Add-Type @" 
using System; 
using System.Runtime.InteropServices; 
public static class WinRect { 
[DllImport("user32.dll")] public static extern bool GetWindowRect(IntPtr hWnd, out RECT lpRect); 
[StructLayout(LayoutKind.Sequential)] public struct RECT { public int Left; public int Top; public int Right; public int Bottom; } 
} 
"@ 
$p = Get-Process -Id 
$r = New-Object WinRect+RECT 
[void][WinRect]::GetWindowRect($p.MainWindowHandle, [ref]$r) 
